{"id":"u-5a21bf83-4a3e-46f0-8b62-c753ed7c7cc3","src":"community","title":"SMOLOV Squat and Bench","author":"Adam L.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/TmRXeq-smolov-boostcamp-import-1","desc":"Run either:\nM - W - F - S\n- or -\nM - T - Th - F\n\n13-week squat specialization cycle (Sergey Smolov's Base/Switching/Intense/Taper structure), with bench programmed in parallel rather than run as its own separate block.\nSquat 1RM should be entered conservatively — use ~90-95% of your true tested max, not your gym-day max, since the volume will expose any inflation fast.\nAll other heavy lower-body work (leg press, hack squat) and overhead pressing are removed for the full 13 weeks — there isn't recovery budget left once squat and bench frequency stack up.\n\nHow bench parallels squat across the phases:\n\nWeeks 1-2 (Phase In): Squat ramps up gently 2-3x/week. Bench runs light maintenance work (2x/week, ~75-80%) — just enough to hold ground while squat frequency is still being introduced.\nWeeks 3-5 (Base Cycle): This is where the two lifts run at equal intensity — squat hits its 4-day-a-week base volume, and bench runs the classic Smolov Jr scheme (6x6→7x5→8x4→10x3) on those same four days. Squat and bench peak together here; this is the hardest 3-week stretch of the whole program.\nWeek 6 (Rest + Retest): Both lifts rest, then both get tested for a new 1RM on the same days — this is a shared checkpoint, not just a squat milestone.\nWeeks 7-8 (Switching Phase): Squat backs way off (speed work at 50-60%), which frees up recovery — bench gets its best window to actually build here, running moderate hypertrophy volume (4x6, 3x8) instead of just holding steady.\nWeeks 9-12 (Intense Cycle): Squat climbs into 85-95%+ territory 3x/week. Bench drops to pure maintenance — one session a week at 75%, paired with squat's lighter day, just to keep the groove without competing for recovery.\nWeek 13 (Taper + Test): Both lifts taper down, then test max on the same day (or a day apart) to close out the cycle together.\n\n\nNote: I intentionally left out accessory work - add at you own risk and as personal tolerance dictates. I'm making this public because there does not seem to be anything else like this in the wild. You may choose to just do the squat portion - this is fine. Just skip bench if you want. \n\nHappy lifting.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":12,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-26T21:27:42.421Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":65,"x":3},{"r":5,"pct":70},{"r":2,"pct":75,"x":2},{"r":1,"pct":80}],"note":"65% 1RM - Phase In"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"pctHi":80,"x":3}],"note":"75-80% 1RM"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":65,"x":3},{"r":5,"pct":70},{"r":2,"pct":75,"x":2},{"r":1,"pct":80}],"note":"65% 1RM - Phase In"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":4},{"r":3,"pct":75},{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":2},{"r":1,"pct":90}],"note":"70% 1RM - Phase In"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"pctHi":80,"x":3}],"note":"75-80% 1RM, +5 lb if clean"}]},null],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":80}],"note":"80% 1RM - Phase In"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":3}],"note":"75-80% 1RM"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":82.5}],"note":"82.5% 1RM - Phase In"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":85}],"note":"85% 1RM - Phase In"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":3}],"note":"75-80% 1RM, +5 lb if clean"}]},null],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":9,"pct":70,"x":4}],"note":"70% 1RM - Base Cycle, Week 1 of block"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":70,"x":6}],"note":"70% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 1"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":7,"pct":75,"x":5}],"note":"75% 1RM - Base Cycle, Week 1 of block"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":7}],"note":"75% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 1"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":80,"x":7}],"note":"80% 1RM - Base Cycle, Week 1 of block"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":80,"x":8}],"note":"80% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 1"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":85,"x":10}],"note":"85% 1RM - Base Cycle, Week 1 of block"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":85,"x":10}],"note":"85% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 1"}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":9,"pct":70,"x":4}],"note":"70% 1RM - Base Cycle, +20 lb from Wk3"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":70,"x":6}],"note":"70% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 2, +~5-10 lb from Wk3"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":7,"pct":75,"x":5}],"note":"75% 1RM - Base Cycle, +20 lb from Wk3"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":7}],"note":"75% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 2, +~5-10 lb from Wk3"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":80,"x":7}],"note":"80% 1RM - Base Cycle, +20 lb from Wk3"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":80,"x":8}],"note":"80% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 2, +~5-10 lb from Wk3"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":85,"x":10}],"note":"85% 1RM - Base Cycle, +20 lb from Wk3"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":85,"x":10}],"note":"85% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 2, +~5-10 lb from Wk3"}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":9,"pct":70,"x":4}],"note":"70% 1RM - Base Cycle, +30 lb from Wk3"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":70,"x":6}],"note":"70% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 3, +~5-10 lb from Wk4"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":7,"pct":75,"x":5}],"note":"75% 1RM - Base Cycle, +30 lb from Wk3"},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":7}],"note":"75% 1RM - Smolov Jr Week 3, +~5-10 lb from Wk4"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":80,"x":7}]